public theorem nonempty_generatingSections_dualizing_tensorSheaf_of_isAlgClosed_coherent
    [IsAlgClosed S.k]
    (L : S.X.Modules) [SheafOfModules.IsInvertible S.X.presheaf S.X.ringCatSheaf.2 L]
